MULTIPIC.ZIP
Freeware

Multipic is a small application to view PIC files on  a 3c/a.

One key press allows you to cycle through your file/directory like a slide show.

An easy to use application that will switch bitmap levels. 

One HELP SCREEN give you all the instructions to make MultiPic work.

Using TAB KEY to navigate the Directories will allow you to see pic.
with any extension in any directory

Install Multipic.opa in any \app directory in your 3a/c , install Icon
using Psion + I

Available in English and German in the same ZIP FILE

Multipic remains the property of the author and must be used in its
original form but my be distributed freely.

